    "body": "# What does this PR do ?\n\nRemove the Nsight Systems EFA metrics plugin from all Linux target directories. The existing `target-linux-x64` glob leaves the plugin in ARM target directories.\n\n# Changelog\n\n- In `docker/Dockerfile.ci`, change the cleanup path to `/usr/local/cuda-*/NsightSystems-cli-*/target-linux-*/plugins/efa_metrics/`.\n\n# GitHub Actions CI\n\n- `uv run pre-commit run --all-files` passed in a Python 3.12 container.\n- Temporary `/bin/sh` fixtures verified removal for x64, SBSA, and aarch64 across multiple CUDA/Nsight versions, preservation of unrelated plugins, and success when nothing matches.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- Full container rebuild has not been run.\n\n# Before your PR is \"Ready for review\"\n\n- [x] Contributor guidelines followed; commit signed off.\n- [x] Targeted shell validation completed for the one-line change.\n- [x] No documentation or dependency changes needed.\n\n# Additional Information\n\nPrimary area: `area:build`.\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
